co/x88LzDvL/SPOILER-portrait.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/985a3997/uploads/origins/a81ebbea-2bac-4bd9-9875-b97838845c0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=189ec2a070b17ebb8b8e8c148bee1dfb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/985a3997/uploads/origins/a81ebbea-2bac-4bd9-9875-b97838845c0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=189ec2a070b17ebb8b8e8c148bee1dfb, https://si.imgix.net/985a3997/uploads/origins/a81ebbea-2bac-4bd9-9875-b97838845c0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73f0a9e6f5b5c560b11e7ba54b290c57 2x, https://si.imgix.net/985a3997/uploads/origins/a81ebbea-2bac-4bd9-9875-b97838845c0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c751b9244685c2efa2d44519037c4878 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I would like to request another illustration of Roca Rourin in her new 2.0 outfit. She is an evil and dorky, master mind vtuber.\n\nThis will be another birthday celebration art. Can you please draw something similar to the reference material? Please use Rocas new outfit and use her long hair style. I will leave pose and composition to you. \n\nIf possible, an you please draw this on a horizontal canvas and provide a layered PSD file?\n\nCan Roca have permission to use this for SNS (twitter, youtube, schedule, etc)? If this is not ok, please decline.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fSK4w3p483cTB75x7lfyODZoMsiRWF_B?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f6f9b73d/uploads/origins/e6c8c345-66ee-48fb-98f5-f59d9420386b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6e1ed534a0d7059c1a84d52a6f0f541", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f6f9b73d/uploads/origins/e6c8c345-66ee-48fb-98f5-f59d9420386b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6e1ed534a0d7059c1a84d52a6f0f541, https://si.imgix.net/f6f9b73d/uploads/origins/e6c8c345-66ee-48fb-98f5-f59d9420386b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adfac7e47ee65fd2d7c987bb83495c1c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f6f9b73d/uploads/origins/e6c8c345-66ee-48fb-98f5-f59d9420386b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75e4aaf58bddbc1e3f3ab9e9d6f1a34a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、はじめまして。\n先生のご作品を以前より拝見しており、いつも心惹かれております。\nこのたび、ご縁がありましたら、ぜひイラストをお願いしたくリクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\n構図やポーズ、背景などの詳細は、すべて先生のご判断にお任せいたします。\n作品は個人での鑑賞およびSNSでの使用を目的としており、商用利用は一切いたしません。\n\nご多忙のところ恐縮ではございますが、\nご検討いただけましたら幸いです。何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます🙇‍♀️\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ezb2BumEF57cUSDAYn1PgxK-lb3rfMWa?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/25c648eb/uploads/origins/420d6c6e-834e-4a62-8148-869ad1fc079b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=411ed70c1501224ddd4f19017dfe8863", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/25c648eb/uploads/origins/420d6c6e-834e-4a62-8148-869ad1fc079b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=411ed70c1501224ddd4f19017dfe8863, https://si.imgix.net/25c648eb/uploads/origins/420d6c6e-834e-4a62-8148-869ad1fc079b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47897456e8a0f2dc664efd39e5deea55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/25c648eb/uploads/origins/420d6c6e-834e-4a62-8148-869ad1fc079b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbe4727d514c224b9aa584240fc91033 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I would like to request another illustration of Roca Rourin.\n\nThis will be to celebrate Rocas Birthday! Can you please draw something similar to the reference image? Please have Roca performing on stage for a birthday concert.  Please have her wear a cool black dress and black hair ribbons. Please do not use her original hair ornaments. I will leave hair style, pose, and composition to you, so feel free to be creative.\n\nCan you please draw this on a horizontal canvas and provide a layered PSD file?\n\nCan Roca have permission to use this for SNS (twitter, youtube, schedule, etc)? If this is not ok, please decline.\n\nReference:  https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VdVQi40wWVfrgQAJcxk2-lgBylHxXF8r?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef8aac41/uploads/origins/1f817600-6d6b-4b9b-a5d1-b60d9d0fd53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e1a2e0688a0b154e3cafbeea2dde0af", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ef8aac41/uploads/origins/1f817600-6d6b-4b9b-a5d1-b60d9d0fd53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e1a2e0688a0b154e3cafbeea2dde0af, https://si.imgix.net/ef8aac41/uploads/origins/1f817600-6d6b-4b9b-a5d1-b60d9d0fd53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0009bd66d8f2f32aa24b954cfbe5197 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef8aac41/uploads/origins/1f817600-6d6b-4b9b-a5d1-b60d9d0fd53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e64dcc5bfbac867703df94b60236a7fc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your artstyle and coloring! I would like to request an illustration of Roca Rourin. She is a rock and roll, demon lord Vtuber.\n\nCan you draw something similar to the reference image? Please have Roca swimming underwater with different tropical fish. Please give Roca a cute swimsuit and do not use her original hair accessories. If possible, can you please draw with a horizontal canvas? I will leave pose and expression to you, so feel free to be creative.\n\nCan Roca have permission to use this for SNS (twitter, youtube, schedule, etc)? If this is not ok, please decline.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15DYbxnJlpT7VqPJSnr3xZwksclxwTIta?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/24405feb/uploads/origins/7e80cd78-4b83-4f07-9237-33628c983b02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2e08df26e3a5349aaa1e197d24dba5d2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/24405feb/uploads/origins/7e80cd78-4b83-4f07-9237-33628c983b02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2e08df26e3a5349aaa1e197d24dba5d2, https://si.imgix.net/24405feb/uploads/origins/7e80cd78-4b83-4f07-9237-33628c983b02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=17206407e101a26b440d885dd5ee4404 2x, https://si.imgix.net/24405feb/uploads/origins/7e80cd78-4b83-4f07-9237-33628c983b02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e2f4b61dd1ea535acb50101be3346168 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@murumuru106/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/31fa8cfe/uploads/origins/056fd1d1-3989-4099-bb2f-bca8a77d407d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6f85ec543b74aab54421e9dff098ce43", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix